5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,460
What did Lord Fuyin say?

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:15,710
Lord Fuyin asked me to pay attention to Cao Yun

7
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:18,710
He said that he was just afraid that the other party would stop Cao Yun and take revenge.

8
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,710
