9
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,870
Eighty percent of Cao Yun in Beijing is from the Lianshui Gang.

10
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:25,870
That being the case

11
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:28,540
Then I'll handle it myself

12
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,540
How is it

13
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:36,820
Dare to frame me?

14
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,890
This Cao Yun is unacceptable

15
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:39,890
Dare to frame me?

16
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:42,980
This Cao Yun gang also has a place to die Mu Ying

17
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:48,260
Are you interested in doing more than big shopping? Big buying is good

18
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,940
Absolutely a big buy

19
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,940
What simple thing do I need to do?

20
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:52,940
Wait for my notification

21
00:00:52,940 --> 00:01:00,910
Just lend me your escort, okay?

22
00:01:00,910 --> 00:01:01,910
Please ask Brother Chu Yue by the way.

23
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:04,070
Do you want to participate?

24
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:05,070
Got it
